 1113 #uuid "6966f4d8-cdcd-5ca4-b362-30814d3591d1" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324145 1145 "The points in our set include all those that lie *above* the line $y=2.$\n\nTherefore, a point $P(x,y)$ lies *inside* the shaded region if the following condition is satisfied:\n\n$$\ny>2\n$$\n\nSince the boundary is *not* included in the set (the curve is *not* solid),  no further action must be taken, so we have\n\n$$\ny>2.\n$$\n\nMoreover, since we're considering *every* real value in this region, $x\\in R,y\\in R,$ and therefore \n\n$$\n(x,y)\\in R\\times R={R}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the set as\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,y>2}.\n$$" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324146 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324147 13194139534976 true] [17592186324146 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324148 13194139534976 true] [17592186324146 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324149 13194139534976 true] [17592186324146 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324150 13194139534976 true] [17592186324146 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139534976 true] [17592186324146 1041 "field-1" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324146 1104 #edb/ref 17592186324147 13194139534976 true] [17592186324146 1110 #uuid "b8221f01-9849-5913-806f-8febfb7e471a" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324147 1034 "{R}^{2}" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324147 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534976 true] [17592186324147 1111 #uuid "fc636fc0-a884-5e6f-8e2f-eb0acc20b395" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324148 1034 "C" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324148 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534976 true] [17592186324148 1111 #uuid "61da26c7-e591-5968-b270-3b14d8b86c1d" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324149 1034 "{C}^{2}" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324149 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534976 true] [17592186324149 1111 #uuid "e4895942-3164-5d01-80ce-c091c763efd9" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324150 1034 "R" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324150 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534976 true] [17592186324150 1111 #uuid "86001284-c8ed-50a8-b244-67de7558bd6c" 131