2/assets/f54c771d1b7045bbaa301c9d595a45dc64fbdfc6b1c83c152fb6fc892373ea06.png)\n\nDescribe the shaded region shown above using set-builder notation.\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {{field-1}}\\,:\\,y\\,{{field-2}}\\,-1}\n$$" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324157 1113 #uuid "c3a75647-b6f0-514a-9eb0-d39182f0d5fe" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324157 1145 "Since all points $P(x,y)$ in our set lie at integer values of $x$ and $y,$ we have $x\\in Z,y\\in Z,$ and therefore \n\n$$\n(x,y)\\in Z\\times Z={Z}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThe points in our set include all those that lie *above* the line $y=-1.$ For those points, the following condition is satisfied:\n\n$$\ny>-1\n$$\n\nAlso, notice that some points in our set lie *on* the line. We include these points by changing the inequality symbol above as follows:\n\n$$\ny\\ge -1\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the set as follows:\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {Z}^{2}\\,:\\,y\\ge -1}\n$$" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324159 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324160 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324161 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324162 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324163 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324164 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1041 "field-1" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1104 #edb/ref 17592186324162 13194139534976 true] [17592186324158 1110 #uuid "ff26241f-131f-5db2-8b74-8136257a631e" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324159 1034 "{R}^{2}" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324159 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534976 true] [17592186324159 1111 #uuid "4ccef57f-a6ae-5d6e-8b8e-7c40e3d9356a" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324160 1034 "N" 13194139534976 true] [17592186324160 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534976 true] [17592186324160 1111 #uuid "3cd2743d-d43b-5e2d-b01c-a07dfd8dafd9" 13194139534976 true] [17592